fitoroñañe fanjàka te amy zay re henaneo amy te ie ty mpañalañalam-pañina soa",{"noteId":39},", mifototse am-pitamàñe soa te ama’e."]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["Aa naho tsy nanan-kila i fañina valoha’ey, le tsy nipaiaeñe ty faharoe."]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["Fa ninjè’e ami’ty hoe:",{"text":"Inao, ho tondroke ty andro, hoe t’Iehovà,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"te hilaharako fañina vao","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"amy anjomba’ Israeley","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"naho amy anjomba’ i Joday—","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"tsy manahake i fañina nanoeko","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"aman-droae’ iareo","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"amy andro nitanatanàko","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"vaho niaolòako iareo","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"niakatse an-tane Mitsraimeiy;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"amy t’ie tsy nahatañe i fañinakoy,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"le niambohoako, hoe t’Iehovà.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Zao ka ty fañina horizako","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ami’ty anjomba’ Israele,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"naho fa añe i andro rey,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"hoe t’Iehovà.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Hajoko an-tro’ iareo ao i Hà-koy","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"naho ho sokireko añ’arofo’ iareo ao:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"le ho Andrianañahare’ iareo iraho,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"vaho h’ondatiko iereo.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Le tsy songa hifañoke o mpitrao-pimoneñeo, naho tsy sindre hanao aman-drahalahi’e,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ty hoe: Mahafohìna Iehovà,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"amy te fonga hahafohiñe ahy,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ty kede pak’ an-joke’e.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Fa ho ferenaiñako ty hatsivokara’iareo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"vaho tsy ho tiahiko ka o tahi’ iareoo.","poem":1},{"noteId":40}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["Ie nanao ty hoe: Vaoeñe, le fa nampiantere’e i taoloy, le fa himosaoñe o raha mihamodo naho miha-antetseo."]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":38,"caller":"+","text":"Avo 25:40","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":5}},{"noteId":39,"caller":"+","text":"Heb 9:15, 12:24 (in telo ato)","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":6}},{"noteId":40,"caller":"+","text":"Irm 31:31-34, Oni: Heb 10:16-17","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":12}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/tdx_sle/HEB/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/tdx_sle/HEB/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/tdx_sle/HEB/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}